@page
@model PrivacyModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/Home.css" asp-append-version="true" />
}

<section class="privacy-section">
    <div class="faq-container">
        <h1 class="faq-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="privacy-updated">Last updated: September 2026</p>

        <p class="privacy-intro">
            CarMark ("we", "our", or "us") is an online marketplace that connects car buyers and sellers.
            This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your personal information when
            you use our website to buy, sell, or browse vehicle listings.
        </p>

        <div class="privacy-block">
            <h3>1. Information We Collect</h3>
            <p>When you create an account, list a vehicle, or contact a seller, we may collect:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Your name, email address, and phone number</li>
                <li>Login credentials and account preferences</li>
                <li>Vehicle listing details (make, model, year, price, photos, description)</li>
                <li>Messages exchanged between buyers and sellers through our platform</li>
                <li>Technical data such as IP address, browser type, and device information</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="privacy-block">
            <h3>2. How We Use Your Information</h3>
            <p>We use the collected information to:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Create and manage your account</li>
                <li>Display your vehicle listings to potential buyers</li>
                <li>Facilitate communication between buyers and sellers</li>
                <li>Improve our platform, services, and user experience</li>
                <li>Send important updates, offers, and account notifications</li>
                <li>Prevent fraud and enforce our Terms of Service</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="privacy-block">
            <h3>3. Sharing of Information</h3>
            <p>
                We do not sell your personal data to third parties. Your contact information may be shared
                with another user only when necessary to complete a transaction (for example, when a buyer
                contacts a seller about a listed vehicle). We may also share data with service providers who
                help us operate the platform (such as hosting and payment processors), under strict
                confidentiality agreements.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="privacy-block">
            <h3>4. Cookies</h3>
            <p>
                CarMark uses cookies to keep you logged in, remember your preferences, and analyze site
                traffic. You can disable cookies in your browser settings, but some features of the website
                may not work properly without them.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="privacy-block">
            <h3>5. Data Security</h3>
            <p>
                We implement technical and organizational measures to protect your personal data against
                unauthorized access, loss, or misuse. However, no method of transmission over the internet
                is 100% secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="privacy-block">
            <h3>6. Your Rights</h3>
            <p>You have the right to:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Access, update, or delete your personal information</li>
                <li>Request a copy of the data we hold about you</li>
                <li>Withdraw consent for marketing communications at any time</li>
                <li>Deactivate your account and remove your listings</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="privacy-block">
            <h3>7. Data Retention</h3>
            <p>
                We retain your personal information for as long as your account is active or as needed to
                provide our services, comply with legal obligations, resolve disputes, and enforce our
                agreements.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="privacy-block">
            <h3>8. Children's Privacy</h3>
            <p>
                CarMark is not intended for individuals under the age of 18. We do not knowingly collect
                personal information from minors.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="privacy-block">
            <h3>9. Changes to This Policy</h3>
            <p>
                We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page
                with an updated revision date.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="privacy-block">
            <h3>10. Contact Us</h3>
            <p>
                If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or how we handle your data, please
                contact us at <a href="mailto:ExampleEmail@email.com">ExampleEmail@email.com</a>.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>